  "description": "Non-material amendments to planning permission reference: 2013/01865/FR3 dated 8th August 2013 for the \"Redevelopment comprising erection of a four storey building providing 8 flats (2 x 1 bed, 6 x 2 bed) together with two, 2 storey 3 bedroom dwelling houses; with associated parking, landscaping, and alterations to the existing footpath and vehicles access, following demolition of four garages.\"  Amendments include: internal layout changes to flats, hallways and cycle stores: alterations to the fenestration including window and door locations: replacement of French doors and Juliette balconies to bathrooms with rooflights: installation of a lift over run; alterations to terrace privacy screens to the houses and amendments to landscaping including paths and planted areas.",
